# P47 layout (32-bit, measured from the blob): the WHOLE VPcmFloModem, 0x7f68 bytes (VPCMXF_Create: sysdep_malloc(0x7f68) + VPcmFloModem::VPcmFloModem).  Supersedes test/vpcm/vpcm_flo_modem_run.layout (P46 = v90RunDemodulator + runPcmModem, which
# kept named unknown regions for this chunk): every member the 26 P47 methods (24 functions + the C2 / D2 twins; `member_map.py blob --class VPcmFloModem`) and the constructor touch is real and named.  CHANGES against vpcm_flo_modem_run.layout: the
# ANSam detector / SineWave block (0x6f5c) is a real ANSamToneDetector (0x3c) + 4 words + a real SineWave<float,float> (0x10) + 4 words (the QC line verification state), the CP frame buffers are u16 arrays (the blob copies them as
# `short`), the 0x7dd8 .. 0x7f27 tail is four 21-element arrays (the V.34 probing-result words / the L2 levels the phase 2 info records point to), the GenericIIR<float,double> at 0x7f28 is real; pads / stored words are named
# (w611c_ -> v92Session_, w1740_ -> constelCtr_, b7dd1_ -> cpnotCopied_, w1738_ -> bitPtr_, w7dd4_ -> cpSeqCnt_, w7dd6_ -> minTxSeq_, pad611a_ 2 bytes stay a pad).  The V90Modem (+0x1758, P45), V92Modem (+0x6124, P45), V92EchoCanceller (+0x6bd0, P22)
# and tagV90DILdescriptor (+4, P13) sub-objects are as in vpcm_flo_modem_run.layout (members FLATTENED `name=sub.member`, pointer-holding sub-objects between `align8` markers: P45 / P28 convention).  ALL pointers are `ptr-into-heap` (normalised by the
# dump, never dumped through).  Two PLAIN RECORDS the methods write through V90Modem::info_ / V92Modem::info_ (the P06 V90Phase2Info / V92Phase2Info classes keep 8 / 4 unnamed bytes where the blob stores four array pointers; the P47 VIEWS
# below name them, so the x86-64 offsets are consistent with the harness mirror; the heap blocks the V90Modem constructor allocates for them are sysdep_malloc(0x24 / 0x2c), too small for the x86-64 views: P06 must be converted before
# an x86-64 build runs the real objects together).
# regenerate: tools/layout_gen.py layouts/vpcm/vpcm_flo_modem.layout --chunk p47 --out-port src/vpcm/vpcm_flo_modem_layout.inc --port-header vpcm/vpcm_flo_modem.h --inc-banner chunk
